    "rationale": "Weight-stationary 16x16 tiles: A k-half tiles loaded once to spad rows 0 and 16; for each of the 5 n-blocks, B tile (k=0..15) is mvin'd to spad row 32, overwrite-computed with A k-half 0 (k-order 0..15), then B tile (k=16..31) mvin'd to the same spad rows, accumulate-computed with A k-half 1 (k-order 16..31), and mvout from accumulator rows 0-15 (bit31+bit29 set; bit30 distinguishes overwrite 2684354560 vs accumulate 3758096384). Scratchpad usage peaks at 48 of 80 rows. Total mvin bytes = 2*256 (A) + 10*256 (B) = 3072, the minimum since every B tile is used exactly once and each A tile is loaded a single time for all 5 reuses; 42 commands with one final fence."
